 StyleBox["Answer 3",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\nThe square bracket needs to be removed\nvariable is t, not x"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9469509860110264`*^9, 3.946951033660797*^9}, {
